# Celadon City (FireRed's MUS_CELADON, which the city, its rooms, Route 16's house and Route 12's fishing house
# share): an easy-going city stroll in F, a flute tune over an electric piano's off-beat chords and a walking bass,
# for the city of flowers and the great department store. Original composition for this game (plan 19 · K5).
